  "body": "Refs #45\n\n## Changes\n\n- Animate the Outlined border and Filled indicator between 1 dp and 3 dp.\n  Use Fast Effects for the Outlined width and Fast Spatial for the Filled\n  width. Keep the editor, caret and trailing action in place.\n- Blend border colors independently. Keep their motion continuous during\n  focus reversal and validation changes. Reduce Motion applies the final\n  width and color immediately.\n- Use the enabled border color from the first frame after re-enabling\n  a field.\n\n## Verification\n\n- The tested source tree is `87f50f8095b38a4ba37c83f71aaf1119dda945dc`.\n  The workspace passed 1,587 Rust tests and three WebAssembly checks.\n- Apple Metal passed 18 offscreen tests. Two native headless replays\n  produced 18 matching PNGs through Page.screenshot, CLI and MCP.\n- Chrome WebGPU passed 355 Material steps and 28,425 checks. The headless\n  guard observed no visible windows and found no surviving processes.\n  The offline verifier checked 2,424 pixels across 33 original PNGs.\n- The first-frame regression failed on the baseline. All 19 focused\n  field tests passed with the fix.\n\n[Reproduction commands, logs and original PNGs](https://github.com/faberline/surface/tree/e908b0bd8dace94551f53a592fc1637accde9131/docs/evidence/md3/text-field-boundary-v0170-corrected-runtime)\n",
  "changed_files": 12,
